Probably not in full. Under the current terms (version terms-2026-08), a vehicle booking cancelled at least 24 hours before departure gets a full refund. Cancelling less than 24 hours before departure gets 50 per cent back.

So if your sailing is more than 24 hours after you cancel, you get everything back. If you cancel the day before, it depends on the exact time: the sailing needs to be at least 24 hours away when you cancel. Otherwise you'd get 50 per cent.
